  "summaries": {
    "en": "Persona 5 Strikers guide—Persona switching mid-combat, jail clearing strategies, and Merciless difficulty prep.",
    "ja": "P5S攻略。戦闘中ペルソナ切り替え・監獄クリア戦略・メルシレス難易度準備を解説。"
  },
  "category": "action-rpg",
